%% Lab 01: the support desk conversation as two calls to Chat Completions. Our code (lime notes) builds and sends
%% the whole message list each time; the model (ink) answers from that list only and keeps nothing between the calls.
%% Export: npx -y @mermaid-js/mermaid-cli -i lab01_message_list.mmd -o lab01_message_list.png -b white -s 2
sequenceDiagram
    participant Code as Our code<br>(holds the list)
    participant Model as Chat Completions API<br>(the model)

    Note over Code: [DESK, customer_1]
    Code->>Model: create: 2 messages
    Model-->>Code: assistant reply
    Note over Model: keeps nothing<br>after the reply
    Note over Code: desk_history = [DESK,<br>customer_1,<br>assistant: the reply,<br>customer_2]
    Code->>Model: create: 4 messages
    Model-->>Code: a note that names order 46
    Note over Code,Model: the note names order 46 only because<br>our code sent the first turn again
